11
00:58:26,250 --> 00:58:32,250
Ghost Town is a 1988 American Western horror film directed by Richard McCarthy (under the
pseudonym Richard Governor) and starring Franc Luz and Catherine Hickland.

12
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
Based on a story by David Schmoeller, it follows a sheriff who finds himself amongst
the dead residents of a ghost town while searching for a missing woman.

13
01:09:03,750 --> 01:09:09,750
The film was one of the last to be released by producer
Charles Band's production company Empire Pictures.

14
01:14:22,500 --> 01:14:28,500
The film explores themes of outlaw, curse, shootout.

15
01:19:41,250 --> 01:19:47,250
The tone is dark.
